When generating git commit messages:
1. Language: Simplified Chinese only.
2. Format: type(scope): description
3. Types in Chinese mapping: feat→新特性, fix→修复, docs→文档, style→格式, refactor→重构, perf→性能, test→测试, chore→构建/工具
4. Example: "fix(登录模块): 修复验证码刷新后不更新的问题"
5. Keep the subject line under 50 characters if possible.